{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399930/extras/9617489b59c1c6a3c8a92f8b440b3538.avif?t=1757164517\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roulette Dungeon is a turn-based roguelike where you spin a roulette wheel to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the balance between strategic planning and unpredictable luck by placing bets, using special abilities, and collecting items to outsmart your foes and conquer the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399930/extras/293d97d145d6b47b270366e2e3b4f8dc.poster.avif?t=1757164517\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399930/extras/293d97d145d6b47b270366e2e3b4f8dc.webm?t=1757164517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399930/extras/293d97d145d6b47b270366e2e3b4f8dc.mp4?t=1757164517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPIN YOUR WHEEL TO VICTORY!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find items to create tons of unique playstyles, collect chips to place your bets &amp; use all of your resources (and a little bit of luck) to defeat your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399930/extras/4eb903989a138ea6bb68bc46c03bc4ac.poster.avif?t=1757164517\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399930/extras/4eb903989a138ea6bb68bc46c03bc4ac.webm?t=1757164517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399930/extras/4eb903989a138ea6bb68bc46c03bc4ac.mp4?t=1757164517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONQUER THE DUNGEON!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique take on the roguelike genre with a focus on roulette mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of characters, each with their own abilities &amp; strengths!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless different item combinations leading to a vast amount of unique playstyles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place bets to earn more chips &amp; increase your chances of success!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your well earned chips for upgrades, on the slot machine, to play the shell game &amp; more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399930/extras/480b8575d32481545c5bf3797b675b3b.poster.avif?t=1757164517\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399930/extras/480b8575d32481545c5bf3797b675b3b.webm?t=1757164517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399930/extras/480b8575d32481545c5bf3797b675b3b.mp4?t=1757164517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3399930?t=1757164517","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399930/b34a6c327c8d1bcb77977dc40e9b1657192f66a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757164517","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399930/f7f8fb4bee455f34e3fb56df5d7ec378141706c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757164517","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_